@zgabi We found why the button fix didn't work in your build — the buttons had `Anchor = Top | Right` set in the designer, which overrides the repositioning during WinForms layout. The `RepositionButtons()` code was correct but the anchor snapped the buttons back.

**Fixed now** — buttons are switched to `Anchor = Top | Left` before repositioning, so the calculated width and position stick.

The fix will be in the next nightly. Thanks for confirming it wasn't working!

@zgabi **Fixed in commit 6e0ef3c** — the Disconnect button now shows the full Hungarian text "Kapcsolat bontása" without truncation.

